        "language": "english",
        "review": "I like jank and I paid $1.50 for this so I'd normally be fine with what's here, but the description of the game appears to be false. It talks about diverse missions but there only appears to be one. You'll get to seal that rift like the description says but there are no demons, no civilians, etc. You get the one mission and that's it. I've cleared the mission in both solo and co-op just to check and there's nothing else. The game's not in early access either so what's on the store page should reflect what's in the game. \n\nThere's little in this game that isn't buggy so progression might be another casualty and I paid next to nothing so for now, I'll just leave this review.",
